SCOPE
=====

The grant below covers the source code and the artwork scripts/art.mjs draws:
the coin hoard, the HUD backdrops and the action icons.

It does not cover the eight portraits in portraits/, nor the images the build
composites from them -- imgs/tiles/*.png, imgs/keys/launcher*.png and
imgs/plugin/icon*.png. Those were produced with a generative image model, and in
most jurisdictions -- the European Union and the United States among them --
copyright requires a human intellectual creation, so it is doubtful that any
copyright subsists in them at all. We therefore assert none, and grant none. In practice
you may do as you like with them; we simply cannot license what we may not own.

Note that the composited tiles combine a portrait with the coin hoard drawn by
scripts/art.mjs. The drawn half is covered by this licence regardless.

One thing no copyright licence can settle: the portraits are recognisable
likenesses of living public figures, and personality and publicity rights are a
separate body of law that varies by country. Nothing here waives them or gives
you permission with respect to the people depicted. If you reuse these images,
that judgement is yours. The project is built to make substitution easy -- see
"Swapping the figures" in the README.

Third-party code bundled into bin/plugin.js is MIT-licensed and stays MIT. Its
notices are in com.goldenbunker.whackadictator.sdPlugin/THIRD-PARTY-NOTICES.md.

